<dp:subject>Error with your forwarded email: {{ subject }}</dp:subject>
We have detected the email you just sent as a forwarded message.
However, we were unable to determine the original email or original author so no new
ticket was created.

<br /><br />

If you need to start a new ticket for a user, please use the agent web interface
at <a href="{{ app.getSetting('core.deskpro_url') }}agent/">{{ app.getSetting('core.deskpro_url') }}agent/</a>

<br /><br />

If you did NOT want to create a new ticket on behalf of a user, you can re-send the email without the 'FW:' or 'FWD:' prefix
in the subject line. This will create a new ticket from you instead.